# Milestone: M6 wave 1 (partial — atom auto-boxing on slot install deferred)
# Origin: legacy tests/2.x/atoms.chk
# Covers: atom-clone returns the atom value directly + atom + atom
#         arithmetic remains valid post-clone.
#
# Wave-1 partial port: the legacy fixture also exercises
# `var one.foo = "foobar"` (slot install on a cloned-atom value), then
# expects `1.foo` and `2.foo` to fail with "lookup failed".  v1.0 does
# not yet auto-box atoms on slot install (the `urbi_slot_set_slow` path
# would need to allocate a fresh UObject inheriting from the atom proto
# and rebind the local).  Defers to Wave 2.

var one = 1.clone()
[00000000] 1

var two = 2.clone()
[00000001] 2

one + two
[00000002] 3
